    "backstoryNotes": "On a personal journey to, in the eyes of the Ovex Nexus, reach maturity. Ada, or, as the Nexus knows it, OVX-9482-Sub-1850, is exploring the known universe, posing as a common sentient biological lifeform. This Ovex chose the appearance of an Acconian female. She is well-rounded at the waist, short, with long, bright, multi colored hair."
